    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob",
        "text": "If there's really no other way, Skadi... then I'll fight you to the very end."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Skadi",
        "text": "So these are the types of people you've chosen to ally yourself with?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_010#2",
            "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Grani",
        "text": "What will happen to Dewville after you take the treasure?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_010#2",
            "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob",
        "text": "No matter what happens, they will still survive. The same cannot be said for us."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob",
        "text": "Even though I haven't known you for long, I can tell what kind of person you are."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob",
        "text": "You aren't prejudiced against the Infected, unlike that monster standing next to you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Grani",
        "text": "(Skadi probably isn't prejudiced either... She just wants you out of her way, Infected or not...)"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_010#2",
            "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob",
        "text": "Grani, tell me where Carol is!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob",
        "text": "You know how much this treasure means to us!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_010#2",
            "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Grani",
        "text": "Sorry, Big Bob, but that's not a part of my mission."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Grani",
        "text": "My only mission is to help Carol find the treasure, and restore peace to her village."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_263_skadi#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Skadi",
        "text": "I don't care about any of that. Just hand Carol over to me."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_010#2",
            "name2": "char_263_skadi#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob",
        "text": "What do you need that girl for anyway, you monster?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob",
        "text": "Do you plan to skin her alive? Drink her blood?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob",
        "text": "You already heard the kid. She won't hand the chief over to you no matter what!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob",
        "text": "However, I just want the treasure. I won't lay a finger on the girl!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
